{%- doc -%}
  Renders the predictive search products list for empty state and recently viewed products

  @param {string} title - title of the result list
  @param {object[]} products - array of products
  @param {string[]} [order_ids] - array of product ids
  @param {number} [limit] - limit of products to display
  @param {string} [products_test_id] - a playwright test id, used to differentiate empty state from 'real' search results
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  assign recently_viewed_title_text = 'content.recently_viewed_products' | t
-%}
<div
  id="predictive-search-products"
  class="predictive-search-results__products"
  {% if products_test_id %}
    data-testid="{{ products_test_id }}"
  {% endif %}
>
  {% if title == recently_viewed_title_text %}
    <div
      class="recently-viewed-wrapper"
      ref="recentlyViewedWrapper"
    >
      <h4
        class="predictive-search-results__title"
        ref="recentlyViewedTitle[]"
      >
        {{ title }}
        <button
          class="predictive-search-results__clear button button-unstyled"
          type="button"
          on:click="/clearRecentlyViewedProducts"
        >
          {{ 'actions.clear' | t }}
        </button>
      </h4>
      <ul
        class="predictive-search-results__list predictive-search-results__wrapper-products list-unstyled"
      >
        {% liquid
          assign limit = limit | default: 8
        %}
        {% comment %}
          If we're searching for recently viewed products by id, we need to reorder the products.
          The order here comes from the search terms, and we display the products in the order of the ids.
        {% endcomment %}
        {% if order_ids != blank %}
          {% for _id in order_ids %}
            {% assign int_id = _id | times: 1 %}
            {% assign product = products | find: 'id', int_id %}
            {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-missing-recent{%- endcomment -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              A recently-viewed id can miss: the product may since have been
              unpublished or deleted, and `find` then yields nil. The card snippet
              already guards and emits nothing, but assets/predictive-search.js
              collects `.predictive-search-results__card` unconditionally, so the
              bare native <li> below would stay an arrow-key stop that renders
              nothing and does nothing on Enter. Skip the row entirely instead.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if product != blank -%}
            {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-missing-recent{%- endcomment -%}
            <li
              class="predictive-search-results__card predictive-search-results__card--product"
              ref="recentlyViewedItems[]"
            >
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-global-card{%- endcomment -%}
              {%- comment -%}
              Global card. snippets/resource-card.liquid reads exactly one theme
              setting and hardcodes both a cross-fade hover and a 4 / 5 media ratio, so
              the popup ignored every global product card setting. Suppressed rather
              than deleted, per the wrap-never-delete rule; the native bytes below are
              byte-identical to the pinned Horizon base and must be re-applied after a
              bump. The replacement snippet's first child must stay the
              `a.product-card__link`, which assets/predictive-search.js activates with
              querySelector('a').click() on Enter.
                          {%- endcomment -%}
              {% if false %}
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-global-card{%- endcomment -%}
              {% render 'resource-card',
                resource_type: 'product',
                resource: product,
                image_width: 500,
                image_hover: true,
                image_aspect_ratio: '4 / 5',
                product_view_context: 'search'
              %}
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-global-card-close{%- endcomment -%}
              {% endif %}
              {% render 'bmp-global-product-card',
                product: product,
                image_sizes: '(min-width: 850px) 17vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 45vw',
                loading: 'lazy',
                product_view_context: 'search',
                id_prefix: 'ps-recent-'
              %}
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-global-card-close{%- endcomment -%}
            </li>
            {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-missing-recent-close{%- endcomment -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-missing-recent-close{%- endcomment -%}
          {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
          {% for product in products limit: limit %}
            <li
              class="predictive-search-results__card predictive-search-results__card--product"
              ref="recentlyViewedItems[]"
            >
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-global-card{%- endcomment -%}
              {%- comment -%}
              Global card. snippets/resource-card.liquid reads exactly one theme
              setting and hardcodes both a cross-fade hover and a 4 / 5 media ratio, so
              the popup ignored every global product card setting. Suppressed rather
              than deleted, per the wrap-never-delete rule; the native bytes below are
              byte-identical to the pinned Horizon base and must be re-applied after a
              bump. The replacement snippet's first child must stay the
              `a.product-card__link`, which assets/predictive-search.js activates with
              querySelector('a').click() on Enter.
                          {%- endcomment -%}
              {% if false %}
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-global-card{%- endcomment -%}
              {% render 'resource-card',
                resource_type: 'product',
                resource: product,
                image_width: 500,
                image_hover: true,
                image_aspect_ratio: '4 / 5',
                product_view_context: 'search'
              %}
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-global-card-close{%- endcomment -%}
              {% endif %}
              {% render 'bmp-global-product-card',
                product: product,
                image_sizes: '(min-width: 850px) 17vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 45vw',
                loading: 'lazy',
                product_view_context: 'search',
                id_prefix: 'ps-recent-'
              %}
              {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-global-card-close{%- endcomment -%}
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <h4 class="predictive-search-results__title">
      {{ title }}
    </h4>
    <ul
      class="predictive-search-results__list predictive-search-results__wrapper-products list-unstyled"
    >
      {% liquid
        assign limit = limit | default: 8
      %}
      {% for product in products limit: limit %}
        <li
          class="predictive-search-results__card predictive-search-results__card--product"
          ref="resultsItems[]"
        >
          {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-global-card{%- endcomment -%}
          {%- comment -%}
          Global card. snippets/resource-card.liquid reads exactly one theme
          setting and hardcodes both a cross-fade hover and a 4 / 5 media ratio, so
          the popup ignored every global product card setting. Suppressed rather
          than deleted, per the wrap-never-delete rule; the native bytes below are
          byte-identical to the pinned Horizon base and must be re-applied after a
          bump. The replacement snippet's first child must stay the
          `a.product-card__link`, which assets/predictive-search.js activates with
          querySelector('a').click() on Enter.
                      {%- endcomment -%}
          {% if false %}
          {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-global-card{%- endcomment -%}
          {% render 'resource-card',
            resource_type: 'product',
            resource: product,
            image_width: 500,
            image_hover: true,
            image_aspect_ratio: '4 / 5',
            product_view_context: 'search'
          %}
          {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-START:search-global-card-close{%- endcomment -%}
          {% endif %}
          {% render 'bmp-global-product-card',
            product: product,
            image_sizes: '(min-width: 850px) 17vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 45vw',
            loading: 'lazy',
            product_view_context: 'search',
            id_prefix: 'ps-results-'
          %}
          {%- comment -%}BMP-HOOK-END:search-global-card-close{%- endcomment -%}
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% endif %}
</div>
